  "notes": [
    "All 29 Minimal role values are present in the supplied light CSS. Short hex is expanded and case is normalized.",
    "Surface, geometry, water, greenery, and road assignments are authored semantic mappings of those source tokens. The pastes contain no vector cartographic style.",
    "The first pass\u2019s invented beige, olive, and blue-gray colors were removed. The map-shell cream #f9f5ed is recorded in the original paste but is no longer the template canvas.",
    "The light :root block is authoritative. Dark-mode overrides, alpha tokens with misleading names, compiler flags, layout rules, utility classes, and proprietary font/symbol references are excluded.",
    "Minimal is light-only. Colors are serialized as six-digit sRGB hex for the target map configuration."
  ],
